.TH PSMatrixLength 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSMatrixLength

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/maths.h>

.I
uint64_t  
.br
\fBPSMatrixLength\fR(\fIPSMatrix matrix\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get the total number of values belonging to \fImatrix\fR (ie. a matrix with shape (2,3) will return 6).  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The total number of values belonging to \fImatrix\fR or zero if \fImatrix\fR is \fINULL\fR.
